{"overview":"ناتسوکی سوبارو، یک دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی معمولی، در راه بازگشت از خواربارفروشی به خانه است که خود را در دنیایی دیگر می‌یابد. در حالی که در این دنیای جدید گم‌گشته و سردرگم است و حتی چپ و راست را نمی‌شناسد، تنها کسی که به او کمک می‌کند دختری زیبا با موهای نقره‌ای است. سوبارو که مصمم است به نوعی محبت او را در نجات دادنش از ناامیدی جبران کند، موافقت می‌کند به دختر در پیدا کردن چیزی که به دنبالش است کمک کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Natsuki Subaru, an ordinary high school  student, is on his way home from the convenience store when he finds  himself transported to another world. As he's lost and confused in a new  world where he doesn't even know left from right, the only person to  reach out to him was a beautiful girl with silver hair. Determined to  repay her somehow for saving him from his own despair, Subaru agrees to  help the girl find something she's looking for.","tagline_en":"Racing through the journey of memories——","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":90,"y":2016,"poster":"/4Gsh6zCE6SYNlal3FW6scj3PkAz.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":85,"y":2016,"poster":"/nLgY9Ped6ABn7XPKT84RBKG2Lvm.jpg"}],"episodes":85,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小林裕介","role":"Subaru Natsuki (voice)","photo":"/y4ukKDSobZJNuB4H3k89hkrKCDC.jpg","en":"Yusuke Kobayashi"},{"name":"高橋李依","role":"Emilia (voice)","photo":"/aeB7z0cBTASdjKOjQriBAO6hYq4.jpg","en":"Rie Takahashi"},{"name":"内山夕実","role":"Puck (voice)","photo":"/JvavoF3YOLCf4LHfl4XvYobANE.jpg","en":"Yumi Uchiyama"},{"name":"ری موراکاوا","role":"Ram (voice)","photo":"/pawIx7uhV1a2fAHjvTnrCP0KcHX.jpg","en":"Rie Murakawa"},{"name":"水瀬いのり","role":"Rem (voice)","photo":"/cqOrQDUbbQLKpujzcK47YqjFdNp.jpg","en":"Inori Minase"},{"name":"新井里美","role":"Beatrice (voice)","photo":"/v95wU1gpSLAOJS5yKFTxyheXAW2.jpg","en":"Satomi Arai"}],"trailer":"P4l9d-rlD4o","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/65942-re/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","l